---
// The most important UX decision on the page.
// Two equal tiles. Three-second self-sort.
---

<section id="fork" class="section" aria-label="How would you like to work with us?">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:gap-5">
      <a
        href="#project-types"
        class="group relative block border border-edge bg-ink/40 p-8 md:p-10 lg:p-12 transition-all duration-300 ease-punch hover:border-paper hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      >
        <div class="eyebrow">Track A · Turnkey</div>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-h1 font-extrabold tracking-tightest">
          Build <span class="hl">with us</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-mute max-w-md leading-relaxed">
          You have a goal — a launch, an activation, a stand, a piece. We take it
          end-to-end from idea to installed.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-spec text-sm">
          See project types
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a
        href="#capabilities"
        class="group relative block border border-edge bg-ink/40 p-8 md:p-10 lg:p-12 transition-all duration-300 ease-punch hover:border-paper hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      >
        <div class="eyebrow">Track B · Shopping list</div>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-h1 font-extrabold tracking-tightest">
          Make <span class="hl">a part</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-mute max-w-md leading-relaxed">
          You have a parts list — laser cuts, prints, 3D pieces. Send it over.
          We quote, we fabricate, we ship.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-spec text-sm">
          See capabilities
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
